  "contentHtml": "\n\n                    <!-- Display video article in news article for the custom next story -->\n                    \n                    <!-- Modifying the body placing embeds,promoslots,related etc.-->\n                                        <figure><img src=\"/images/default.jpg\" alt=\"\"></figure><p>Mumbai: Longevity healthcare start-up, <a href=\"/tag/vytalyou\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Vytalyou</a> has raised Rs 9 rore in a <a href=\"/tag/pre-series+a+funding\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">pre-series A funding</a> round from Chetan Jain of Pharma Dose and Ratan Jain of Venus Industries to expand its clinic network.The deal sets the firm’s valuation at approximately Rs 33 crore and will fund its two new Mumbai centres by the end of this year.Vytalyou has an existing facility in Powai, Mumbai and plans to expand to 10 locations across India in coming years, it said.</p><!-- PROMOSLOT_M --><p>According to the start-up its model combines predictive diagnostics with a broad range of personalized preventive therapies to help push back <a href=\"/tag/chronic+lifestyle+diseases\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">chronic lifestyle diseases</a>.</p>\n                            <p>Advt\n                            </p>\n\n                              \n                                                         \n                        <p>It used an AI-based algorithm to assess an individual’s health profile, biological ageing and potential areas of future risk which is then reviewed by doctors to shape a medically supervised plan.                    </p><!-- Category Most Read Placement -->\n                                                                    \n                                                                \n                                <ul>\n                                                                            <!-- <li>By <span>Online Bureau</span>,</li> -->\n            